    "occurred_at": "2026-10-01T14:41:00Z",
    "revision": 1,
    "text": "只有这个对话框里的。你发什么我看什么，别的没接进来——我刚查了一遍，我这头是空的。"
   },
   {
    "metadata": {
     "dimension": "dim:user_ai_interaction",
     "role": "user",
     "session_id": "wx_studio",
     "turn_index": 6,
     "turn_key": "5c3f412de7fb32654aef8cc5"
    },
    "object_id": "obs_conv_user_79691e61d5de0b065de994b5",
    "object_type": "observation",
    "occurred_at": "2026-10-01T14:41:00Z",
    "revision": 1,
    "text": "刚装的这个 你能看见我手机上的东西吗"
   },
   {
    "metadata": {
     "dimension": "dim:user_ai_interaction",
     "role": "assistant",
     "session_id": "wx_studio",
     "turn_index": 8,
     "turn_key": "94e5ae4c12d2fcd2c95bf60e"
    },
    "object_id": "obs_conv_ai_354f45a3278e15a2794336c3",
    "object_type": "observation",
    "occurred_at": "2026-10-01T14:46:00Z",
    "revision": 1,
    "text": "好。睡吧。"
