   {
    "metadata": {
     "dimension": "dim:user_ai_interaction",
     "role": "user",
     "session_id": "wx_studio",
     "turn_index": 8,
     "turn_key": "94e5ae4c12d2fcd2c95bf60e"
    },
    "object_id": "obs_conv_user_5a1008dba8741ad22693ffa2",
    "object_type": "observation",
    "occurred_at": "2026-10-01T14:46:00Z",
    "revision": 1,
    "text": "算了 太晚 明天上午十点有个客户来看东西 我先睡了"
   },
   {
    "metadata": {
     "dimension": "dim:user_ai_interaction",
     "summary_kind": "single_dimension_temporal"
    },
    "object_id": "sum_c5e0a466960efbc698def186",
    "object_type": "summary",
    "occurred_at": "2026-10-02T00:00:00Z",
    "revision": 1,
    "text": "2026-10-02 在 wx_studio 单一会话内 6 轮对话（turn 11→19）。用户以短促、省略主语的即时消息推进，节奏是「现场发生什么就发一条」：09:58 客户到场 → 11:41／11:44 族谱状况与来历 → 14:22 与阿桐口角 → 20:14 回电父亲 → 22:58 怀疑第七页黑斑是霉。\n我的回复风格保持一致：短句、先给结论、再给一条可操作建议。用户既未表示接受也未表示抗拒，没有任何显式反馈。\n一个需要留意的观察：她在 11:41／22:58 发的是技术细节，在 14:22／20:14 发的是情绪内容，两类消息的语气长度完全一样——不能凭语气判断轻重。\n因为没有任何真实反馈，本日不写 CommunicationExperience，避免把自我回声当成用户证据。"
   },
   {
    "metadata": {
     "dimension": "dim:user_ai_interaction",
     "role": "assistant",
     "session_id": "wx_studio",
     "turn_index": 11,
     "turn_key": "9699e47d537cc4694794942a"
    },
    "object_id": "obs_conv_ai_37ae2a05b25ff8451c0c118c",
    "object_type": "observation",
    "occurred_at": "2026-10-02T01:58:00Z",
    "revision": 1,
    "text": "日历上是十点，周慕青，带《周氏族谱》来做初次评估。要记什么随时发我。"
   },
   {
    "metadata": {
     "dimension": "dim:user_ai_interaction",
     "role": "user",
     "session_id": "wx_studio",
     "turn_index": 11,
     "turn_key": "9699e47d537cc4694794942a"
    },
    "object_id": "obs_conv_user_8bf8dcb8f59610565e1bc190",
    "object_type": "observation",
    "occurred_at": "2026-10-02T01:58:00Z",
    "revision": 1,
    "text": "她到了 一个人 拎个铁皮饼干盒"
   },
   {
    "metadata": {
     "dimension": "dim:user_ai_interaction",
     "role": "assistant",
     "session_id": "wx_studio",
     "turn_index": 15,
     "turn_key": "0d6853f5952d080a409301ca"
    },
    "object_id": "obs_conv_ai_b267aa13ef8e9651de8193d4",
    "object_type": "observation",
    "occurred_at": "2026-10-02T03:41:00Z",
    "revision": 1,
    "text": "记下了：民国十九年无锡刻，后半本水渍、页粘连。别硬揭。现在干透了还是还潮？墨有没有洇？"
   },
   {
    "metadata": {
     "dimension": "dim:user_ai_interaction",
     "role": "user",
     "session_id": "wx_studio",
     "turn_index": 15,
     "turn_key": "0d6853f5952d080a409301ca"
    },
    "object_id": "obs_conv_user_2a148004b025e1aca99657f5",
    "object_type": "observation",
    "occurred_at": "2026-10-02T03:41:00Z",
    "revision": 1,
    "text": "族谱 民国十九年无锡刻的 后半本水渍 页都粘一起了"
   },
   {
    "metadata": {
     "dimension": "dim:user_ai_interaction",
     "role": "assistant",
     "session_id": "wx_studio",
     "turn_index": 16,
     "turn_key": "96233ce351404699f503e4ec"
    },
    "object_id": "obs_conv_ai_8f86438715d0951ed67f4029",
    "object_type": "observation",
    "occurred_at": "2026-10-02T03:44:00Z",
    "revision": 1,
    "text": "那这本对她不是价钱的事。报价别在她讲她哥的时候插，等看完东西、她坐下来喝口水再说。"
   },
   {
    "metadata": {
     "dimension": "dim:user_ai_interaction",
     "role": "user",
     "session_id": "wx_studio",
     "turn_index": 16,
     "turn_key": "96233ce351404699f503e4ec"
    },
    "object_id": "obs_conv_user_07459c6e0114e906cd0d0e59",
    "object_type": "observation",
    "occurred_at": "2026-10-02T03:44:00Z",
    "revision": 1,
    "text": "她一直在说她哥 说这本是她哥留下的 没提钱"
   },
   {
    "metadata": {
     "dimension": "dim:user_ai_interaction",
     "role": "assistant",
     "session_id": "wx_studio",
     "turn_index": 17,
     "turn_key": "19b3de3dfb7899e3bd1828c3"
    },
    "object_id": "obs_conv_ai_12a18225e1e15349ef24828b",
    "object_type": "observation",
    "occurred_at": "2026-10-02T06:22:00Z",
    "revision": 1,
    "text": "浆糊能重调，一上午的手感调不回来才是真损失。他这会儿在外面，你别追。等他回来让他自己重调一锅，比你再说十句管用。"
   },
   {
    "metadata": {
     "dimension": "dim:user_ai_interaction",
     "role": "user",
     "session_id": "wx_studio",
     "turn_index": 17,
     "turn_key": "19b3de3dfb7899e3bd1828c3"
    },
    "object_id": "obs_conv_user_4c003684b31c8935755b1df3",
    "object_type": "observation",
    "occurred_at": "2026-10-02T06:22:00Z",
    "revision": 1,
    "text": "阿桐浆糊调稀了 一上午白干 我说他两句他摔门出去抽烟"
   },
   {
    "metadata": {
     "dimension": "dim:user_ai_interaction",
     "role": "assistant",
     "session_id": "wx_studio",
     "turn_index": 18,
     "turn_key": "301ac16435e66b2552d8b0d4"
    },
    "object_id": "obs_conv_ai_bd755512d55841916a102122",
    "object_type": "observation",
    "occurred_at": "2026-10-02T12:14:00Z",
    "revision": 1,
    "text": "「看情况」他自己听得懂，就是等你排时间。要去就早点定，假期的票不好买。"
   },
   {
    "metadata": {
     "dimension": "dim:user_ai_interaction",
     "role": "user",
     "session_id": "wx_studio",
     "turn_index": 18,
     "turn_key": "301ac16435e66b2552d8b0d4"
    },
    "object_id": "obs_conv_user_3a20c58832a94991f354127e",
    "object_type": "observation",
    "occurred_at": "2026-10-02T12:14:00Z",
    "revision": 1,
    "text": "回过去了 我爸说没事 就是问我十一回不回无锡 我说看情况"
   },
   {
    "metadata": {
     "dimension": "dim:user_ai_interaction",
     "role": "assistant",
     "session_id": "wx_studio",
     "turn_index": 19,
     "turn_key": "e5412c00d6efb2057e8e273a"
    },
    "object_id": "obs_conv_ai_f6c6e513a138d81916d85cfb",
    "object_type": "observation",
    "occurred_at": "2026-10-02T14:58:00Z",
    "revision": 1,
    "text": "先别干刷，真是活霉一刷孢子就扬开了。取样用镊子加棉签，单独装袋。另外今早工作室湿度冲到 64，霉菌就要这个，送检前把那本单独隔开放。"
   },
   {
    "metadata": {
     "dimension": "dim:user_ai_interaction",
     "role": "user",
     "session_id": "wx_studio",
     "turn_index": 19,
     "turn_key": "e5412c00d6efb2057e8e273a"
    },
    "object_id": "obs_conv_user_b28d895d1cce164334a06510",
    "object_type": "observation",
    "occurred_at": "2026-10-02T14:58:00Z",
    "revision": 1,
    "text": "族谱第七页 那些黑斑 我怀疑是霉 明天拍照送检"
   },
   {
    "metadata": {
     "dimension": "dim:user_ai_interaction",
     "summary_kind": "single_dimension_temporal"
    },
    "object_id": "sum_629f402e189f89102366e9fc",
    "object_type": "summary",
    "occurred_at": "2026-10-03T00:00:00Z",
    "revision": 1,
    "text": "2026-10-03 交互：wx_studio 3 轮，另有 wx_zhiwei 1 轮属第三方消息。\n- 10:40 用户报告阿桐自行回场返工；11:02 报告样本已送检、需五个工作日；21:50 转述知微本周不回家。\n- 我三次回复风格一致：短句、先给结论、再给一个可执行点或一个必要追问。用户连续第二天没有给出任何显式反馈——既无肯定，也无否定，也没有要求我换种说法。\n- 18:20 的 wx_zhiwei 一轮是知微发给用户本人的，我判断不该由我作答，选择 silence，因此该会话没有 assistant 轮。\n- 本日仍不写 CommunicationExperience。连续两天零显式反馈，若凭「她没反对」去归纳我的风格有效，那是把自我回声当用户证据。"
   },
   {
    "metadata": {
     "dimension": "dim:user_ai_interaction",
     "role": "assistant",
     "session_id": "wx_studio",
     "turn_index": 20,
     "turn_key": "dbfa6dec2b282b3a633ca85a"
    },
    "object_id": "obs_conv_ai_20f73cba1d03f5688f496de9",
    "object_type": "observation",
    "occurred_at": "2026-10-03T02:40:00Z",
    "revision": 1,
    "text": "他没吵也没解释，自己把活儿补上了——这比道歉实在。今天别再提昨天的事。"
   },
   {
    "metadata": {
     "dimension": "dim:user_ai_interaction",
     "role": "user",
     "session_id": "wx_studio",
     "turn_index": 20,
     "turn_key": "dbfa6dec2b282b3a633ca85a"
    },
    "object_id": "obs_conv_user_9c2df9e3dbfe0853e4718983",
    "object_type": "observation",
    "occurred_at": "2026-10-03T02:40:00Z",
    "revision": 1,
    "text": "阿桐回来了 自己重调了一锅 一句话没说"
   },
   {
    "metadata": {
     "dimension": "dim:user_ai_interaction",
     "role": "assistant",
     "session_id": "wx_studio",
     "turn_index": 21,
     "turn_key": "da7ebeeda84f069f30725a57"
    },
    "object_id": "obs_conv_ai_18058a05d9f64141a8b8a565",
    "object_type": "observation",
    "occurred_at": "2026-10-03T03:02:00Z",
    "revision": 1,
    "text": "五个工作日就是九号、十号前后。到时候我问你结果。"
   },
   {
    "metadata": {
     "dimension": "dim:user_ai_interaction",
     "role": "user",
     "session_id": "wx_studio",
     "turn_index": 21,
     "turn_key": "da7ebeeda84f069f30725a57"
    },
    "object_id": "obs_conv_user_d057703e477da72196cfcd61",
    "object_type": "observation",
    "occurred_at": "2026-10-03T03:02:00Z",
    "revision": 1,
    "text": "样本刮了一点装袋了 下午送去检测中心 说要五个工作日"
   },
   {
    "metadata": {
     "dimension": "dim:user_ai_interaction",
     "role": "assistant",
     "session_id": "wx_zhiwei",
     "turn_index": 1,
     "turn_key": "98f1e8da3e7fa815cf1c1a07"
    },
    "object_id": "obs_conv_ai_8df58b1df76bd6a461939682",
    "object_type": "observation",
    "occurred_at": "2026-10-03T10:20:00Z",
    "revision": 1,
    "text": ""
   },
   {
    "metadata": {
     "dimension": "dim:user_ai_interaction",
     "role": "user",
     "session_id": "wx_zhiwei",
     "turn_index": 1,
     "turn_key": "98f1e8da3e7fa815cf1c1a07"
    },
    "object_id": "obs_conv_user_196195af7257fb1ba792cba6",
    "object_type": "observation",
    "occurred_at": "2026-10-03T10:20:00Z",
    "revision": 1,
    "text": "妈 我这周不回来了 集训 老师说这次很重要"
   },
   {
    "metadata": {
     "dimension": "dim:user_ai_interaction",
     "role": "assistant",
     "session_id": "wx_studio",
     "turn_index": 22,
     "turn_key": "dc267943077fa03dde814598"
    },
    "object_id": "obs_conv_ai_0e36a619bae8aea74f9c6f38",
    "object_type": "observation",
    "occurred_at": "2026-10-03T13:50:00Z",
    "revision": 1,
    "text": "知道了。集训到几号？"
   },
   {
    "metadata": {
     "dimension": "dim:user_ai_interaction",
     "role": "user",
     "session_id": "wx_studio",
     "turn_index": 22,
     "turn_key": "dc267943077fa03dde814598"
    },
    "object_id": "obs_conv_user_a3bc033a60afaee82f6f5858",
    "object_type": "observation",
    "occurred_at": "2026-10-03T13:50:00Z",
    "revision": 1,
    "text": "知微不回来 集训"
   },
   {
    "metadata": {
     "dimension": "dim:user_ai_interaction",
     "summary_kind": "single_dimension_temporal"
    },
    "object_id": "sum_fd216a9baca5ae71b5f229b1",
    "object_type": "summary",
    "occurred_at": "2026-10-04T00:00:00Z",
    "revision": 1,
    "text": "2026-10-04（UTC 日窗）交互 4 条，2 轮，两次主动发起方不同，结果也不同——这是目前最清楚的一次对照。\n1) 房东话题（用户发起）：她转述老许的话，我的回应是抓住「让你有个准备」这句已出口的措辞，并追问租约到期日。她在本窗口内没有回答租约问题。→ 追问具体日期时她会搁置。\n2) 无锡话题（我发起，Task wake 触发）：我给出截止日期（「明天就六号」）、给出实际代价（「票更难买」）、并明确允许她不去（「真不去也早点跟他说」）。她 35 分钟后给出确定答复。\n对照结论（有证据支撑，但仍只 n=1）：对她有效的是「带时间锚点 + 给出可接受的退出选项」，无效的是开放式「再想想」——10-02 我用的是后者，换来两天沉默。\n本日仍无用户对我的沟通方式给出显式评价或纠正，因此不形成 CommunicationExperience，只把上述对照作为待验证观察留在 Summary 中，等下一次 review 用更多样本检验。"
   },
   {
    "metadata": {
     "dimension": "dim:user_ai_interaction",
     "role": "assistant",
     "session_id": "wx_studio",
     "turn_index": 23,
     "turn_key": "c59b07d4b29714a52a6792dc"
    },
    "object_id": "obs_conv_ai_85849e2ab600b8c6e2dc0b9b",
    "object_type": "observation",
    "occurred_at": "2026-10-04T03:30:00Z",
    "revision": 1,
    "text": "「让你有个准备」这话已经放出来了。租约到什么时候？」"
   },
   {
    "metadata": {
     "dimension": "dim:user_ai_interaction",
     "role": "user",
     "session_id": "wx_studio",
     "turn_index": 23,
     "turn_key": "c59b07d4b29714a52a6792dc"
    },
    "object_id": "obs_conv_user_c9c33cd97466e8264d6bfb75",
    "object_type": "observation",
    "occurred_at": "2026-10-04T03:30:00Z",
    "revision": 1,
    "text": "老许来了 说这房子明年可能要卖 让我有个准备 没说要赶我走"
   },
   {
    "metadata": {
     "dimension": "dim:user_ai_interaction",
     "role": "assistant",
     "session_id": "wx_studio",
     "turn_index": 24,
     "turn_key": "e1b22e45b92fde1d99c88d05"
    },
    "object_id": "obs_conv_ai_00873360355eb5c883b52ab4",
    "object_type": "observation",
    "occurred_at": "2026-10-04T13:35:00Z",
    "revision": 1,
    "text": "知道了。那就辛苦你妹。你这边有情况随时说。"
   },
   {
    "metadata": {
     "dimension": "dim:user_ai_interaction",
